 big problem with  these situations is um governments all  over the world always want to be seen to  be doing the right thing but often are  scared to do the right thing um to  really do the right thing one has to  make a list of the top 50 um oligarchs  who are looking after putin's money and  then start to sanction them and and  everybody who's involved in that knows  how angry putin will get and they're  kind of scared of making him angry but  this is the one thing that he'll listen  to  you um  mentioned earlier on in this  conversation  your lawyer and i think your friend  sergey magnitsky who was killed  in 2009  um  the sanctions against russia  bear his name  but  mr putin is still where he is he still  all seems all powerful  how do you feel about the fact that  somehow  nothing seems to be able to shift this  guy  well um  it's very frustrating to watch um putin  carrying on just getting stronger and  stronger um  and it's also frustrating that having  passed the magnitsky act  in the uk and actually in 33 other  countries  is not more readily used because  we know that this works and we know it  works because putin got so furious about  it when it first was passed in the  united states and in other countries  in the united states after it was passed  he banned the adoption of russian  orphans by american families and made it  his single largest foreign policy  priority to repeal the magnitsky act and  he's been following me all around the  world um trying to do whatever he can to  stop the magnitsky act from being passed  he sent one of his emissaries to trump  tower shortly before donald trump was  elected trying to get the magnitsky act  repealed and so we know that this is  something he cares about um everybody  who's involved um in russian opposition  uh in russian politics who aren't there  understand that this is the tool to get  him this is putin's achilles heel um  this is what he really cares about and  so it's really a question of  using this tool now  instead of just having it and and if we  use it properly and if we use it against  these oligarchs it will stop him

